# ==============================================================================
# NetTrigger - 严格隐私与 Git 忽略规则规范
# ==============================================================================

# 1. 核心敏感凭据与配置文件 (绝对严禁提交！)
# 忽略任何层级下的真实配置文件
**/config.toml
config.toml
config.*.toml
*.local.toml
*.secret.toml
*.credentials.toml

# 白名单保留公开的配置示例模板
!config.example.toml

# 凭据、私钥与环境配置
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
*.p12
*.cer
*.crt
credentials.*
secrets.*

# 抓包、诊断与包含密码的临时导入文件 (F12 导出防泄露)
*.har
*.pcap
*.pcapng
*.curl
*.txt.bak
*.toml.bak
*.toml.old
*.tmp

# 2. Rust / Cargo 编译产物
/target/
**/target/
Cargo.lock.bak
**/*.rs.bk

# 3. 运行日志与崩溃转储
*.log
logs/
*.dmp
*.dump

# 4. 操作系统临时文件与缩略图
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.DS_Store

# 5. IDE、编辑器与本地工作区
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
*.sublime-project
*.sublime-workspace

# 6. AI 编程助手与本地测试沙盒隔离
.gemini/
.antigravity/
.agent/
scratch/
